OL,3,APip benefit system 'not fit for
OL,4,Apurpose' and 'dehumanising' assessments
OL,5,Ashould change, review finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe report doesn't recommend how to
OL,8,Fsave money on the benefit, the cost of
OL,9,Fwhich is projected to more than double
OL,10,Fbetween 2020 and 2030 - what is Pip?
OL,12,FFour million people claim Pip, a
OL,13,Fregular cash payment towards the extra
OL,14,Fcosts of being disabled. Eligibility
OL,15,Fisn't dependent on income - how much
OL,16,Fmoney do people receive from Pip?
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
