OL,3,AHuntley murderer handed new whole life
OL,4,Ajail term
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing him for what prosecutors
OL,7,Fcalled a "cold-blooded" and planned
OL,8,Fattack, Mr Justice Hilliard KC said
OL,9,FRussell would never be freed from
OL,10,Fprison or eligible for parole.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
