OL,3,AGisele Pelicot 'humiliated' after nude
OL,4,Aphotos sent to media to promote book
OL,5,
OL,6,FGisele Pelicot has said she has been
OL,7,F"once again humiliated" after nude
OL,8,Fimages of her were sent to the media to
OL,9,Fpromote a book about coercive control.
OL,11,FThe 73-year-old told French broadcaster
OL,12,FBFM TV she would take legal action
OL,13,Fagainst the publisher and author of the
OL,14,Fessay.
OL,16,FPelicot made headlines across the world
OL,17,Fwhen she waived her right to anonymity
OL,18,Fin the trial of her then-husband
OL,19,FDominique, who was jailed for 20 years
OL,20,Ffor drugging and raping her, as well as
OL,21,Fallowing other men to rape her while
OL,22,Fshe was unconscious.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
