OL,5,
OL,6,FThe publisher apologised, saying it
OL,7,Fwould no longer print or promote the
OL,8,Fwork after "an unfortunate and
OL,9,Finappropriate communication".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
